  "content": "<p>本模组为Railcraft Reborn添加了原版风格的钢锭与铁轨合成配方</p><p>原版铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_809f258f-37f1-4088-b297-99033016a2d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"144\"></p><p>升降铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a4969615-b91e-42e8-af9c-86c26b5d6cdf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p><p>电力铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ee063670-543b-482b-bc81-14e5abeba861.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"144\"></p><p>高速铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2500c68c-0938-4dff-b923-c0a5a565da06.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\"></p><p>高速电力铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_962ceff1-51c4-4a98-bbf7-f3b670a3afb7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p><p>强化铁轨合成</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0e6ec7f0-c5a7-4c0b-9d7e-90e4b7cc1c6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p><p>通过在原版高炉中熔炼铁锭或打火石获得钢锭</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_e0855fd1-b3f3-493f-865c-7da217f9c8ad.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"203\"></p><p>用于三叉轨、交叉轨和转辙轨的轨道套件配方</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_3f1b57c1-92b8-4f74-b2c6-b1ca5994f4d7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p><p>工作台制作的粉尘变种</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_9ffee205-41de-4179-9279-26fe104a65ef.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>兼容JEI和砖炉</p><p>需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft Reborn</a></p><p>使用MCreator制作</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
